Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.72,0:00:02.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Elon Musk says saving
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.45,0:00:03.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}money is pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.07,0:00:05.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Every month, you put
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.07,0:00:06.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a little money away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.38,0:00:07.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}For later.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.23,0:00:08.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}For the day you stop working.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.95,0:00:10.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In his future, you won't need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.93,0:00:11.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Machines will make
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.68,0:00:12.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}almost everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.71,0:00:13.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}so cheaply that money
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.93,0:00:15.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}won't matter anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.33,0:00:17.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}To him, saving is a bet
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.12,0:00:18.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}against that future.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.53,0:00:19.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So what would have to be true
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.95,0:00:20.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for your savings
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.95,0:00:22.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to stop mattering?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.22,0:00:23.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}He means it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.05,0:00:24.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The richest man on Earth has said
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.58,0:00:26.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it again and again this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.60,0:00:27.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But he has also told
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.77,0:00:28.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}us how to check him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.52,0:00:30.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Part of his future
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.66,0:00:32.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is already here:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.16,0:00:33.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}machines do more
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.34,0:00:34.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and more of the work.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.95,0:00:35.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But the part
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.52,0:00:36.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that would pay for your
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.53,0:00:39.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}old age is still only a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.31,0:00:42.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Last winter, on a podcast
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.15,0:00:43.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}with the entrepreneur
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.09,0:00:44.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Peter Diamandis, he
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.70,0:00:45.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}put it like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.86,0:01:02.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In other words:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.91,0:01:03.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}if his picture
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.74,0:01:05.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of the future comes true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.89,0:01:07.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And behind that picture
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.13,0:01:08.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is a real argument,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.70,0:01:09.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}not a whim.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.90,0:01:11.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Artificial intelligence makes
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.46,0:01:13.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}thinking almost free.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.52,0:01:16.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Robots make labor almost free.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.11,0:01:17.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Then almost anything
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.64,0:01:18.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}costs little more
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.61,0:01:19.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}than its materials
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.72,0:01:21.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and the electricity to make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.67,0:01:22.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And when goods pile
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.61,0:01:24.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}up faster than money,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.04,0:01:25.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}prices don't rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.53,0:01:26.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}They fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.64,0:01:27.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Everyone can afford
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.71,0:01:28.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}what they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.80,0:01:31.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}He calls it universal high income.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.69,0:01:32.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Even he says he doesn't
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.92,0:01:34.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}have it all figured out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.38,0:01:37.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This isn't financial advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.85,0:01:39.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}For his forecast to come true,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.82,0:01:41.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}four things have to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.84,0:01:42.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}For his advice to be
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.91,0:01:45.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}safe to follow, a fifth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.23,0:01:46.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}One: machines make
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.85,0:01:48.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}almost everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.48,0:01:50.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Two: everything gets cheap.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.05,0:01:53.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Three: someone pays you an income.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.84,0:01:56.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Four: it arrives in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.42,0:01:58.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And five: if he's wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.66,0:01:59.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}you're still fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.02,0:02:02.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The first line is where
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.29,0:02:03.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}he's closest to right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.37,0:02:06.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Amazon's warehouses already
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.08,0:02:08.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}run more than a million robots.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.38,0:02:09.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In offices, artificial
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.84,0:02:11.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}intelligence writes first drafts,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.72,0:02:14.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}checks code, answers customers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.22,0:02:15.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It isn't almost everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.81,0:02:16.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.69,0:02:18.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But it's spreading fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.36,0:02:19.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And by his own guess,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.54,0:02:21.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}superintelligence alone would
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.30,0:02:22.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}give the world twenty
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.48,0:02:24.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to thirty percent more stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.67,0:02:26.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That's a lot, he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.38,0:02:27.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.33,0:02:29.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But it isn't the end of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.38,0:02:30.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}For that, he says,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.67,0:02:31.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the economy has
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.54,0:02:33.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to reach into space:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.25,0:02:35.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}robots, rockets, and a launcher
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.50,0:02:36.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}on the Moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.92,0:02:39.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So the first line: on its way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.76,0:02:40.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But if machines
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.83,0:02:42.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}make more and more,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.43,0:02:44.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}does everything get cheap?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.34,0:02:47.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Everything gets cheap.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.24,0:02:49.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This is the heart of his argument.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.46,0:02:51.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And half of it is already true.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.98,0:02:53.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}For every dollar a TV
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.45,0:02:55.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}cost in the year 2000,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.16,0:02:56.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the same TV costs
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.74,0:02:58.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}about two cents today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.84,0:02:59.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Software and phone
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.78,0:03:01.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}plans got cheaper too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.48,0:03:02.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But for every dollar
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.96,0:03:04.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of hospital care back then,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.71,0:03:06.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}you now pay almost four.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.14,0:03:08.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Nursing homes, rent
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.56,0:03:09.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and college also
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.68,0:03:10.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}rose far faster
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.97,0:03:12.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}than prices overall.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.81,0:03:14.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The rule behind it is simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.89,0:03:15.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}What a machine can
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.78,0:03:17.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}copy gets cheap.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.74,0:03:19.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}What takes a person's time,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.28,0:03:21.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}or a particular place, does not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.25,0:03:23.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Now look at what you'll
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.17,0:03:24.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}need most when you're old.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.46,0:03:26.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.56,0:03:27.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A hospital bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.99,0:03:29.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Someone to look after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.87,0:03:31.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Care costs what it does
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.40,0:03:33.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}because it's a person's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.55,0:03:34.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Their hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.58,0:03:35.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Their patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.49,0:03:37.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That's what makes it care.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.69,0:03:39.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A year in a nursing home
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.11,0:03:40.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}already costs about as much
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.63,0:03:42.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}as five years of the average
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.47,0:03:44.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Social Security check.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.27,0:03:46.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So the second line: half.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.93,0:03:48.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Things got cheap.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.42,0:03:49.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The things you need
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.25,0:03:51.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}when you're old did not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.87,0:03:52.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This channel exists
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.93,0:03:54.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for one reason:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.40,0:03:55.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}so that the arrival
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.31,0:03:56.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of superintelligence
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.41,0:03:58.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}goes well for everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.27,0:03:59.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Including you, once
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.43,0:04:00.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}you stop working.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.69,0:04:01.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Want that too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.78,0:04:02.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Then subscribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.52,0:04:05.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So when you stop working,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.82,0:04:07.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}who pays for your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.66,0:04:10.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Someone pays you an income.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.74,0:04:11.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}His answer is a
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.79,0:04:13.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}universal high income.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.14,0:04:16.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This spring, he got more specific:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.52,0:04:17.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}checks from the federal
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.72,0:04:18.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}government.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.73,0:04:19.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Remember his advice
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.70,0:04:20.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}about retirement?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.06,0:04:23.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It was an answer to a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.27,0:04:24.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}His host had just asked about
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.98,0:04:25.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the profits from
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.81,0:04:27.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}all those machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.07,0:04:28.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Is that then taxed by the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.93,0:04:30.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}government and redistributed as
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.51,0:04:33.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}some level of income as a UHI
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.89,0:04:35.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Asked who would pay,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.14,0:04:37.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}he moved on to retirement advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.67,0:04:38.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}To be fair,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.70,0:04:40.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}elsewhere in that conversation
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.08,0:04:41.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}he named two ideas:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.93,0:04:43.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}prices will fall,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.27,0:04:44.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and the government
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.30,0:04:46.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}could just issue people money.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.29,0:04:47.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But today, there
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.50,0:04:48.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is no such income.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.07,0:04:49.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}No law.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.97,0:04:50.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}No amount.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.97,0:04:52.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}No budget.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.19,0:04:54.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In Congress, there are a few bills
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.14,0:04:54.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}about artificial
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.00,0:04:56.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}intelligence and jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.74,0:04:58.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}None has passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.30,0:04:59.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And if the government just prints
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.03,0:05:01.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the money for those checks?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.60,0:05:03.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Homes, hospital beds,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.44,0:05:04.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a nurse's hours:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.63,0:05:06.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}they don't multiply.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.28,0:05:07.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That's where new money
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.37,0:05:08.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}would push prices up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.41,0:05:10.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The other way is the one
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.72,0:05:12.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}his host asked about:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.50,0:05:13.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}tax the profits,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.59,0:05:14.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and share them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.10,0:05:16.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This June, the Nobel-winning
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.92,0:05:19.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}economist Daron Acemoglu asked
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.38,0:05:21.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}whether that could be enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.07,0:05:23.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}if machines took over most jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.61,0:05:24.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}His answer:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.50,0:05:28.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But again, there is no evidence
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.30,0:05:30.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}from history to show that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.05,0:05:34.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So the third line: only a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.33,0:05:35.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So far.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.43,0:05:37.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And even if it comes,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.42,0:05:38.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}will it come in time?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.93,0:05:41.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It arrives in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.66,0:05:42.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}For a retirement,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.95,0:05:44.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}timing is everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.08,0:05:46.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Last winter, he said
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.37,0:05:48.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}ten or twenty years.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.44,0:05:49.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This summer, he
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.24,0:05:51.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}named a year: 2036.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.02,0:05:53.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Credit where it's due:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.60,0:05:55.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that's a date you can check.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.37,0:05:56.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But it's still a forecast.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.03,0:05:57.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And your retirement
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.86,0:05:59.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}won't wait for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.22,0:06:00.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}By his own account,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.43,0:06:01.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}artificial intelligence
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.69,0:06:03.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}moves much faster than government.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.96,0:06:04.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That's why he wants
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.81,0:06:06.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the simplest fix:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.19,0:06:07.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}just send people money.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.10,0:06:09.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But checks for everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.33,0:06:10.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}still need Congress.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.00,0:06:12.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And the jobs could be gone
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.07,0:06:14.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}long before Congress moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.14,0:06:16.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So how good are his dates?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.89,0:06:18.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}One of his best-known
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.11,0:06:19.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is about cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.54,0:06:21.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In April 2019,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.20,0:06:23.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}on stage at Tesla's investor
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.12,0:06:24.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}event about self-driving,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.89,0:06:26.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}he gave this date.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.97,0:06:31.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But next year for sure, we will
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.20,0:06:32.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}have over a million robotaxis
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.88,0:06:33.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.22,0:06:35.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}They came.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.38,0:06:36.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Years late.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.63,0:06:38.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A small fleet, not a million.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.02,0:06:40.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Earlier, on that same stage,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.98,0:06:42.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}he'd said it himself:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.80,0:06:44.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}sometimes he's not on time,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.64,0:06:46.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}but he gets it done.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.37,0:06:47.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That's fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.33,0:06:50.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}For a carmaker, late is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.21,0:06:51.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}For your retirement,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.55,0:06:53.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}late is the whole problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.84,0:06:55.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So the fourth line:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.43,0:06:58.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}if his record holds, years late.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.28,0:06:58.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}What if he's not
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.99,0:07:01.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}just late, but wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.12,0:07:04.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}If he's wrong, you're still fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.60,0:07:05.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This is the line
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.39,0:07:06.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}his advice rests on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.33,0:07:09.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Think of it as two bets.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.41,0:07:11.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You keep saving, and he's right:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.76,0:07:12.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}you put away money
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.64,0:07:13.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}you never needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.25,0:07:16.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You stop saving, and he's wrong:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.71,0:07:17.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}you're old,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.56,0:07:18.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and the money isn't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.25,0:07:21.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}One mistake costs you a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.34,0:07:23.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The other costs you your old age.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.12,0:07:25.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Nearly two in three
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.44,0:07:26.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Americans say they worry
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.83,0:07:27.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}more about running out
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.00,0:07:29.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of money than about dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.19,0:07:30.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And the bet isn't
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.01,0:07:32.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the same for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.60,0:07:33.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Musk has said it's
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.61,0:07:35.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}better to be an optimist
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.04,0:07:36.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and wrong than a
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.10,0:07:37.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}pessimist and right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.42,0:07:39.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}He was talking about
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.40,0:07:40.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}quality of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.91,0:07:42.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}There, he may have a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.09,0:07:44.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}With money, it depends
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.50,0:07:45.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}on who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.89,0:07:47.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}For someone who owns the machines,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.68,0:07:49.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}being an optimist and wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.22,0:07:50.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}costs almost nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.06,0:07:51.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}For someone with only
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.94,0:07:53.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a savings account,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.17,0:07:54.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it can cost everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.10,0:07:56.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That's not a charge against him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.78,0:07:58.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It's simply where the risk lands.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.24,0:08:00.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So the fifth line:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.86,0:08:03.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}if he's wrong, the risk is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.63,0:08:05.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Is there a way to make his
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.99,0:08:08.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}promise safe to believe?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.13,0:08:10.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}There is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.08,0:08:11.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It's been done before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.74,0:08:13.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Musk himself expects the years
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.57,0:08:15.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}ahead to bring radical change,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.59,0:08:16.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}social unrest,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.71,0:08:18.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and immense prosperity.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.82,0:08:19.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}People have lived through
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.80,0:08:21.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that once already.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.25,0:08:22.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}When machines turned
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.18,0:08:23.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}work upside down,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.66,0:08:24.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}they faced this
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.46,0:08:26.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}same question: who takes
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.39,0:08:28.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}care of us when we're old?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.43,0:08:30.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Germany answered first.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.34,0:08:32.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In 1889, an old-age
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.43,0:08:33.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}pension became law,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.00,0:08:35.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}paid for by workers,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.34,0:08:37.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}employers and the state.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.29,0:08:39.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}America followed in 1935.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.10,0:08:40.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}At the signing,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.86,0:08:41.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}President Franklin
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.96,0:08:43.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Roosevelt said why.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.02,0:08:46.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Young people have come to wonder
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.80,0:08:48.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}what would be their lot
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.81,0:08:51.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}when they came to old age.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.08,0:08:53.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The man with a job has wondered
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.78,0:08:56.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}how long the job would last.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.75,0:08:58.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}His answer wasn't a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.01,0:09:00.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It was a law.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.35,0:09:02.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}With amounts, with dates,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.10,0:09:03.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and with money set
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.13,0:09:04.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}aside years before
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.44,0:09:06.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the first monthly check.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.33,0:09:08.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Then one winter, a retired woman
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.79,0:09:11.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in Vermont opened her mailbox.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.32,0:09:12.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Ida May Fuller.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.87,0:09:14.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Check number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.39,0:09:15.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}She kept getting them
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.38,0:09:16.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}until she was a hundred.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.06,0:09:18.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Not because someone was generous.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.02,0:09:20.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Because the law said so.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.18,0:09:23.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Even this law needs repairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.35,0:09:24.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Unless Congress acts,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.78,0:09:25.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Social Security
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.68,0:09:26.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}checks will shrink
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.76,0:09:28.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in the early 2030s.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.57,0:09:30.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Shrink, not stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.76,0:09:32.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That's the difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.21,0:09:33.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A promise can be kept.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.03,0:09:35.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A law has to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.48,0:09:37.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}If machines really do
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.93,0:09:39.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}take over the work,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.26,0:09:40.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}an income from all
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.45,0:09:41.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that abundance only counts
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.02,0:09:44.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}once it's built the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.37,0:09:46.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A right, written down,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.34,0:09:48.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}paid for before you need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.80,0:09:50.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The day you stop working:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.51,0:09:52.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a check in your mailbox.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.39,0:09:54.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Not because a forecast came true.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.65,0:09:56.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Because a law says so.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.63,0:09:58.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That law doesn't exist yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.77,0:09:59.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Writing it is up
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.77,0:10:01.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to voters and lawmakers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.92,0:10:04.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The five lines, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.66,0:10:06.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}One, on its way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.81,0:10:08.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}One, half true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.61,0:10:10.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And three that fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.56,0:10:11.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The three that decide
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.71,0:10:13.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}your old age: the income,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.93,0:10:15.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the timing, and who
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.37,0:10:16.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}carries the risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.85,0:10:19.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}As advice, it fails its own test.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.73,0:10:22.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Maybe one day he'll be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.82,0:10:24.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That future would be worth having.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.01,0:10:26.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But someone has to pay
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.31,0:10:27.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for the years in between.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.96,0:10:29.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Until a law does,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.25,0:10:30.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that someone is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.18,0:10:32.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Saving was never a bet
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.60,0:10:33.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}against the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.93,0:10:35.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It's the bridge to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.98,0:10:37.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This channel exists
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.09,0:10:38.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for one reason:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.49,0:10:39.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}so that the arrival
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.41,0:10:40.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of superintelligence goes
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.77,0:10:41.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}well for everybody,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.91,0:10:44.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and everybody makes it across.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.33,0:10:45.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Want that too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.34,0:10:46.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Then subscribe.
